WEBVTT

00:00:00.220 --> 00:00:03.550
Thinking about starting a company in France or the Netherlands?

00:00:03.550 --> 00:00:05.558
Start with a practical question.

00:00:05.558 --> 00:00:07.954
Where will you and your team actually work?

00:00:08.264 --> 00:00:10.151
Now picture your first customer.

00:00:10.151 --> 00:00:11.610
What will you offer them?

00:00:11.610 --> 00:00:13.546
Who’s starting the business with you,

00:00:13.546 --> 00:00:15.128
and when do you hope to open?

00:00:15.488 --> 00:00:17.083
Gather what you already have.

00:00:17.083 --> 00:00:18.954
Do you have an address in mind?

00:00:18.954 --> 00:00:21.111
How will you cover the first few months?

00:00:21.111 --> 00:00:23.053
Jot down anything that’s still open.

00:00:23.533 --> 00:00:27.256
The answers shape the questions you’ll take to a local professional,

00:00:27.256 --> 00:00:29.835
from registration to tax and permits.

00:00:30.215 --> 00:00:31.745
Ready to talk it through?

00:00:31.745 --> 00:00:34.037
Use the consultation link below.

00:00:34.038 --> 00:00:36.248
Tell us where you’d like to start and when,

00:00:36.248 --> 00:00:38.396
and we’ll work through the next step together.
